OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,C'Deep-seated cultural issues' within   
OL,5,Cpolice force                           
OL,6,GEfforts to address "deep-seated        
OL,7,Gcultural issues" have impacted on a    
OL,8,Gpolice force's performance, a police   
OL,9,Gand crime commissioner has said.       
OL,11,FA report by the police inspectorate    
OL,12,Flast month found leadership at         
OL,13,FGloucestershire Constabulary, along    
OL,14,Fwith the way crimes are investigated,  
OL,15,Fto be inadequate.                      
OL,17,FGloucestershire Police and Crime       
OL,18,FCommissioner (PCC) Chris Nelson said   
OL,19,Fup to 50 officers have been suspended  
OL,20,Fat a time during a crackdown on abuses 
OL,21,Fof power and nepotism.                 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
