OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CBlaze at community centre used in      
OL,5,COutlaws TV show                        
OL,6,GFirefighters are responding to a blaze 
OL,7,Gwhich broke out at a derelict          
OL,8,Gcommunity centre which featured in the 
OL,9,Ghit BBC comedy TV series The Outlaws.  
OL,11,FEight fire engines are currently at    
OL,12,Fthe scene of a fire at Sea Mills       
OL,13,FCommunity Centre in Bristol which      
OL,14,Fclosed in 2019.                        
OL,16,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service said some 
OL,17,Fnearby properties had been evacuated   
OL,18,Fand no injuries had been reported.     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
